  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="effective-date"><strong>Effective Date:</strong> July 24, 2026</p>

  <p>This Privacy Policy describes how Property Assistant ("we," "us," or "our") collects, uses, and protects information in connection with our SMS text messaging service for tenant maintenance requests.</p>

  <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>When you text START to (502) 660-8679 to opt in, or otherwise send us a message, we collect and store your mobile phone number along with any messages you send to us regarding maintenance requests, appointments, or related communications.</p>

  <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
  <p>We use your mobile phone number and message content solely to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Respond to and coordinate maintenance requests</li>
    <li>Confirm appointment dates and times</li>
    <li>Send summary confirmations of scheduled appointments or callbacks</li>
    <li>Provide emergency safety instructions when applicable</li>
    <li>Communicate with you regarding your tenancy-related maintenance needs</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Message Frequency</h2>
  <p>Message frequency varies based on maintenance activity and your interactions with the service. You will only receive messages related to maintenance requests you initiate or appointments associated with those requests.</p>

  <h2>Message and Data Rates</h2>
  <p>Message and data rates may apply. Please consult your mobile carrier for details regarding your messaging plan.</p>

  <h2>No Sharing of Mobile Information</h2>
  <p><strong>We do not share, sell, rent, or disclose your mobile phone number or opt-in status to any third party or affiliate for marketing or promotional purposes.</strong> Your mobile information will not be shared for marketing purposes.</p>
  <p>We may share your information only in the following limited circumstances:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>With emergency services or the property manager when necessary to respond to a safety emergency you have reported</li>
    <li>When required by law, subpoena, or legal process</li>
    <li>With service providers who help us operate this messaging service, bound by confidentiality obligations, and only as necessary to provide the service</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Opting Out</h2>
  <p>You may opt out of receiving SMS messages at any time by replying <strong>STOP</strong> to any message. For assistance, reply <strong>HELP</strong>.</p>

  <h2>Data Retention</h2>
  <p>We retain your phone number and message history for as long as necessary to provide the maintenance communication service and to comply with legal obligations.</p>

  <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted at this same location with a revised effective date.</p>

  <h2>Contact Us</h2>
  <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact Gloria Marshall at <a href="mailto:gloriaemarshall@icloud.com">gloriaemarshall@icloud.com</a> or <a href="tel:502-807-6153">502-807-6153</a>.</p>
